              "blocks": {
                "row_ingredients": {
                  "type": "_accordion-row",
                  "settings": {
                    "heading": "Key Ingredients",
                    "open_by_default": false,
                    "icon": "none"
                  },
                  "blocks": {
                    "content": {
                      "type": "text",
                      "settings": {
                        "text": "<p><strong>A doctor-formulated blend of functional ingredients that supports satiety, metabolism, and healthy weight management—without compromising on taste.</strong></p><ul><li>[Clinically studied active ingredient + primary benefit]</li><li>[Clinically studied active ingredient + primary benefit]</li><li>Organic cacao + cocoa for rich chocolate flavor</li><li>Carob for natural depth and sweetness</li><li>Ceylon cinnamon for a warm, balanced finish</li><li>Monk fruit for sweetness without added sugar</li></ul>",
                        "width": "100%",
                        "alignment": "left",
                        "type_preset": "rte"
                      },
                      "blocks": {}
                    }
                  },
                  "block_order": [
                    "content"
                  ]
                },
                "row_how_it_works": {
                  "type": "_accordion-row",
                  "settings": {
                    "heading": "How Does It Work",
                    "open_by_default": false,
                    "icon": "none"
                  },
                  "blocks": {
                    "content": {
                      "type": "text",
                      "settings": {
                        "text": "<p>Daily Melt is a functional hot cacao designed to satisfy chocolate cravings while supporting your metabolism, satiety, and healthy blood sugar balance.</p><p>Powered by clinically studied ingredients, it works with your body’s natural pathways to help you feel satisfied and support healthy weight management—without pills, injections, or stimulants.</p><p>Enjoy it before or after a meal for a chocolate ritual that does more than satisfy your sweet tooth.</p>",
                        "width": "100%",
                        "alignment": "left",
                        "type_preset": "rte"
                      },
                      "blocks": {}
                    }
                  },
                  "block_order": [
                    "content"
                  ]
                },
                "row_who": {
                  "type": "_accordion-row",
                  "settings": {
                    "heading": "Who It’s For",
                    "open_by_default": false,
                    "icon": "none"
                  },
                  "blocks": {
                    "content": {
                      "type": "text",
                      "settings": {
                        "text": "<p>Daily Melt is for anyone who wants to:</p><ul><li>Feel more satisfied between meals</li><li>Support a healthy, active metabolism</li><li>Satisfy chocolate cravings more mindfully</li><li>Support natural GLP-1 and fullness signals</li><li>Make healthy weight management feel more sustainable</li><li>Replace pills and restrictive routines with an enjoyable daily ritual</li></ul>",
                        "width": "100%",
                        "alignment": "left",
                        "type_preset": "rte"
                      },
                      "blocks": {}
                    }
                  },
                  "block_order": [
                    "content"
                  ]
                },
                "row_how_to_use": {
                  "type": "_accordion-row",
                  "settings": {
                    "heading": "How To Use",
                    "open_by_default": false,
                    "icon": "none"
                  },
                  "blocks": {
                    "content": {
                      "type": "text",
                      "settings": {
                        "text": "<p>Blend one scoop with hot water or your favorite milk until smooth and creamy.</p><p>Enjoy it hot, poured over ice, blended into coffee, or prepared in your favorite way. Drink once daily, either before or after a meal, for best results.</p>",
                        "width": "100%",
                        "alignment": "left",
                        "type_preset": "rte"
                      },
                      "blocks": {}
                    }
                  },
                  "block_order": [
                    "content"
                  ]
                },
                "row_taste": {
                  "type": "_accordion-row",
                  "settings": {
                    "heading": "Taste Profile",
                    "open_by_default": false,
                    "icon": "none"
                  },
                  "blocks": {
                    "content": {
                      "type": "text",
                      "settings": {
                        "text": "<p>Organic cacao and cocoa create a rich chocolate base, while carob, Ceylon cinnamon, and monk fruit round out every smooth, creamy cup. It’s indulgent without being overly sweet—like a grown-up hot chocolate made for your daily ritual.</p>",
                        "width": "100%",
                        "alignment": "left",
                        "type_preset": "rte"
                      },
                      "blocks": {}
                    }
                  },
                  "block_order": [
                    "content"
                  ]
                }
